WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
WorkflowHQ
Plan the work. Follow the code. Approve the AI.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.000
01 / The engineering command center
See tickets, reviews and delivery signals in one workspace.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
02 / Give every project a clear home
Projects group outcomes, ownership and delivery progress.

4
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
03 / Keep the work moving
Use the board, filters and accessible status controls.

5
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:38.000
04 / Make done explicit
Ticket hierarchies and acceptance criteria keep scope visible.

6
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
05 / Plan around real deadlines
The calendar puts sample due dates in context.

7
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
06 / Explain progress honestly
Issue counts describe work state, not individual productivity.

8
00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:02.000
07 / AI proposes. You approve.
Backend validation, human review and atomic apply protect writes.

9
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:12.000
08 / Designed with explicit boundaries
React + Express + PostgreSQL; signed webhooks and governed AI.
